WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
We present DS-1000,

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:08.280
a natural and reliable benchmark for data science
code generation.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.460
DS-1000 gathers a thousand real problems across
seven widely used Python libraries such as NumPy and Pandas,

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.640
all drawn from StackOverflow.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:20.820
It pairs these realistic problems with reliable
execution-based evaluation and a built-in

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:25.000
defense against memorization,

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.180
giving the community a trustworthy yardstick for
data science coding models.
